Author: Jérôme Piquot <jpiquot@itaneo.com>
Date:   Fri Apr 24 09:07:01 2026 +0200

    Add comprehensive tests for Natural Language processing components
    
    - Introduced `MemoriesJsonContextCompletenessTests` to ensure all public records/classes in Hexalith.Memories.Contracts.V1 are registered in the JSON source generation context.
    - Added `NaturalLanguageDescriptionOptionsValidatorTests` to validate the behavior of `NaturalLanguageDescriptionOptionsValidator` under various configurations.
    - Created `NaturalLanguageEmbeddingRetryHostedServiceTests` to test the retry workflow instance ID generation and terminal status checks.
    - Implemented `NaturalLanguageResponseCleanerTests` to verify the functionality of `NaturalLanguageResponseCleaner` in cleaning responses.
    - Added `ProjectCompilationTests` to ensure proper suppression of DAPR_CONVERSATION warnings in project files.
    - Developed `IngestionWorkflowDualEmbeddingTests` to validate the dual embedding workflow for different source types and conditions.
    - Created `NaturalLanguageEmbeddingRetryWorkflowTests` to test the retry workflow behavior when memory units are missing or deleted.

